## 12.31 典型处理流程

### 12.31.1 Read Timeout后安全Retry

```text id="p9zj8z"
Read Attempt 1
      │
      ▼
Expected Return未按时到达
      │
      ▼
Timeout Detected
      │
      ▼
Policy允许Retry
      │
      ▼
Fence Attempt 1
      │
      │ Old Return仍可能合法到达
      ▼
Drain / No-old-return Proof
      │
      ▼
Attempt 1 Non-matchable
      │
      ▼
Authorize Attempt 2
      │
      ▼
Fresh GS Admission
      │
      ├── Fresh Expected
      └── Fresh Assembly
```

Timeout本身不会产生No-old-return Proof。

### 12.31.2 Write Retry

```text id="g4i84q"
Write Attempt 1
      │
      ▼
Retryable Result
      │
      ▼
HIF Result Transfer
      │
      ▼
Later Reservation Release
      │
      ▼
Payload READY + Retry Hold
      │
      ▼
Fence Attempt 1
      │
      ▼
Old Status / Drain完成
      │
      ▼
No-old-feedback Proof
      │
      ▼
Authorize Attempt 2
      │
      ▼
GS Admission
      │
      ▼
Attempt 2使用同一Payload
```

### 12.31.3 State Contradiction局部Recovery

```text id="f9s4mx"
BSM/OpenRow Contradiction
       │
       ├── Local Functional WE立即关闭
       ▼
ERROR_CONTAIN
       │
       ▼
Error Manager记录
       │
       ▼
Owner-specific Recovery
       │
       ▼
Physical Closed Proof
OpenRow Invalid
Timing Baseline Ready
Context Match
       │
       ▼
Recovery Complete
       │
       ▼
BSM -> CLOSED
```

### 12.31.4 无法证明Visibility时升级Reset

```text id="ruiloh"
PI / PHY异常
    │
    ▼
Command Visibility Unknown
    │
    ▼
无法形成No-future-feedback Proof
    │
    ▼
